{"seq":3,"slug":"lattice-classes","title":"分配格与模格：格能有多规整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/order-lattice-theory/lattices/lattice-classes","wordCount":1352,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"分配格与模格-格能有多规整\">分配格与模格：格能有多规整</h1><p>不是所有格都一样「乖」。幂集的交并可以自由地互相分配，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\cap(b\\cup c)=(a\\cap b)\\cup(a\\cap c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；但子空间格、划分格却做不到——它们只满足更弱的模律。这一篇给格排出规整程度的谱系：分配格最规整，模格次之，一般格最野；而 M3、N5 两个「禁子」给出干净利落的判定法，Birkhoff 表示定理则把有限分配格全部还原成集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分配律与模律\">核心概念：分配律与模律</h2><p><strong>分配格（distributive lattice）</strong> 要求交对并、并对交都能分配（两条其实等价，有其一即有其二）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∨</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>a</mi><mo>∨</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\wedge (b \\vee c) = (a\\wedge b) \\vee (a\\wedge c), \\qquad\na \\vee (b \\wedge c) = (a\\vee b) \\wedge (a\\vee c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>模格（modular lattice）</strong> 只要求一条更弱的、带前提的分配式——模律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>c</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>∨</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\le c \\;\\Longrightarrow\\; a \\vee (b \\wedge c) = (a\\vee b)\\wedge c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.549em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>模律是分配律的「打折版」：它只在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\le c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 时才要求那半条分配成立。因此分配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span></span></span></span></span> 模，反之不然。下表把三档规整度和代表例子对齐。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规整档次</th>\n<th>满足的律</th>\n<th>代表例子</th>\n<th>是否含禁子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分配格</td>\n<td>分配律（无条件）</td>\n<td>幂集、整除格、任何链</td>\n<td>不含 M3、不含 N5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模格（非分配）</td>\n<td>仅模律</td>\n<td>向量空间的子空间格、正规子群格</td>\n<td>含 M3、不含 N5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般格（非模）</td>\n<td>都不满足</td>\n<td>划分格、含 N5 的格</td>\n<td>含 N5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"m3-与-n5-两个决定命运的禁子\">M3 与 N5：两个决定命运的禁子</h2><p>判定一个格属于哪一档，不必逐条验算无穷多个等式——只需检查它是否「藏着」两个小格。这是格论最优雅的结论之一。</p>\n<p><strong>N5</strong>（五元素五边形格）：由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊥</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bot, \\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊥</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span> 加三个中间元 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a, b, c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 构成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a &lt; c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 在一条边上、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 独在另一边。<strong>M3</strong>（五元素钻石格）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊥</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bot, \\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊥</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span> 加三个两两不可比的中间元 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,b,c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，形如菱形。两条判定定理（Birkhoff / Dedekind）如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>格是模格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.549em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span></span></span></span> 它不含与 N5 同构的子格。</li>\n<li>格是分配格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.549em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span></span></span></span> 它既不含 N5 也不含 M3 的子格。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>于是 M3 恰好是「模但不分配」的最小反例（它是模格却含 M3 自己，故非分配），N5 是「连模都不是」的最小反例。记住这两张五点小图，就能一眼判定规整度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph N5[&quot;N5 (非模)&quot;]&#10;    n0[&quot;⊥&quot;] --&gt; na[&quot;a&quot;]&#10;    n0 --&gt; nb[&quot;b&quot;]&#10;    na --&gt; nc[&quot;c&quot;]&#10;    nc --&gt; n1[&quot;⊤&quot;]&#10;    nb --&gt; n1&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph M3[&quot;M3 (模但非分配)&quot;]&#10;    m0[&quot;⊥&quot;] --&gt; ma[&quot;a&quot;]&#10;    m0 --&gt; mb[&quot;b&quot;]&#10;    m0 --&gt; mc[&quot;c&quot;]&#10;    ma --&gt; m1[&quot;⊤&quot;]&#10;    mb --&gt; m1&#10;    mc --&gt; m1&#10;  end\">graph TD\n  subgraph N5[\"N5 (非模)\"]\n    n0[\"⊥\"] --&gt; na[\"a\"]\n    n0 --&gt; nb[\"b\"]\n    na --&gt; nc[\"c\"]\n    nc --&gt; n1[\"⊤\"]\n    nb --&gt; n1\n  end\n  subgraph M3[\"M3 (模但非分配)\"]\n    m0[\"⊥\"] --&gt; ma[\"a\"]\n    m0 --&gt; mb[\"b\"]\n    m0 --&gt; mc[\"c\"]\n    ma --&gt; m1[\"⊤\"]\n    mb --&gt; m1\n    mc --&gt; m1\n  end</pre><p>这两个禁子的来历各有渊源：子空间格、正规子群格天然是模格（模律对应维数/指数的加法关系），却因含 M3 而非分配；这正解释了为什么线性代数里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U\\cap(V+W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(U\\cap V)+(U\\cap W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。子空间格的模性可回看 <a href=\"lattice-definition\">格的定义</a> 里的子空间格例子；正规子群格的结构见 <a href=\"../../abstract-algebra/groups/subgroups-lagrange\">抽象代数：子群与拉格朗日</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"birkhoff-表示定理-有限分配格就是集合的并交\">Birkhoff 表示定理：有限分配格就是集合的并交</h2><p>分配格之所以是「最乖」的一档，因为它可以被完全还原：每个有限分配格本质上就是「某族集合在并与交下」构成的格。这就是有限分配格的 Birkhoff 表示定理。</p>\n<p>精确表述要用到「并不可约元」（join-irreducible）——不能写成两个更小元之并的非底元素。定理说：有限分配格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 同构于它的并不可约元集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的诱导序下自成一偏序）的全体下集构成的格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}(J(L))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，运算就是集合并与交：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≅</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>下集 </mtext><mi>D</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∨</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\;\\cong\\; \\mathcal{O}(J(L)) = \\{\\,\\text{下集 } D \\subseteq J(L)\\,\\}, \\quad \\vee = \\cup,\\ \\wedge = \\cap</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">下集</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∪</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∩</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一句话，有限分配格与「有限偏序集的下集格」一一对应——序结构与集合结构互为表里。这是 Stone 对偶的雏形，它的「加补」加强版直接催生布尔代数：布尔代数正是每个元素都有补元的分配格，见 <a href=\"../practice/boolean-algebras\">布尔代数</a>。分配律还与逻辑的合取/析取分配、集合的交并分配同源，逻辑侧见 <a href=\"../../mathematical-logic/propositional-logic/truth-tables-normal-forms\">数理逻辑：真值表与范式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么这份谱系值得在意\">为什么这份谱系值得在意</h2><p>规整度不是分类癖。它直接决定「能不能自由地移项化简」。在分配格里，交并可以像加乘一样任意分配展开，逻辑范式、集合恒等式、布尔化简才成立；退到模格，只剩带前提的模律可用，化简受限；再退到一般格，连这点也没有。程序分析设计抽象域时，若能保证抽象值构成分配格，很多算法（如某些数据流方程的精确求解）才有良好性质；否则只能求近似。这条「规整度 → 可算性」的暗线，会在 <a href=\"../practice/order-theory-in-practice\">应用与边界</a> 的抽象域设计里再次出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>规整度谱系：分配格（无条件分配）⊃ 模格（仅带前提的模律）⊃ 一般格。</li>\n<li>判定靠禁子：不含 N5 即模格；既不含 N5 也不含 M3 即分配格。</li>\n<li>M3 是「模但非分配」最小反例（子空间格、正规子群格属此），N5 是「非模」最小反例。</li>\n<li>Birkhoff 表示定理：有限分配格同构于其并不可约元偏序的下集格，即「集合的并交」。</li>\n<li>规整度决定可化简性，是抽象域设计里「结构 → 可算性」的关键权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>前置的格与子空间格例子：<a href=\"lattice-definition\">格的定义</a></li>\n<li>分配格 + 补 = 布尔代数：<a href=\"../practice/boolean-algebras\">布尔代数</a></li>\n<li>抽象域的规整度权衡：<a href=\"../practice/order-theory-in-practice\">应用与边界</a></li>\n<li>逻辑里的分配律同源：<a href=\"../../mathematical-logic/propositional-logic/truth-tables-normal-forms\">数理逻辑：真值表与范式</a></li>\n<li>正规子群格的模性来源：<a href=\"../../abstract-algebra/groups/subgroups-lagrange\">抽象代数：子群与拉格朗日</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分配格与模格：格能有多规整","id":"分配格与模格-格能有多规整"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分配律与模律","id":"核心概念-分配律与模律"},{"level":2,"text":"M3 与 N5：两个决定命运的禁子","id":"m3-与-n5-两个决定命运的禁子"},{"level":2,"text":"Birkhoff 表示定理：有限分配格就是集合的并交","id":"birkhoff-表示定理-有限分配格就是集合的并交"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这份谱系值得在意","id":"为什么这份谱系值得在意"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"完备格：任意子集都有上下确界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/order-lattice-theory/lattices/complete-lattices"},"next":{"title":"Knaster–Tarski 不动点：从存在到可计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/order-lattice-theory/fixpoints/knaster-tarski"}}